{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"3012015020030","name":"凛世","text":"……ぁ────","trans":"……啊────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020050","name":"樹里","text":"────いってきます……","trans":"————我出门了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020060","name":"凛世","text":"……\r\nふふ……ランニング……","trans":"……\n呵呵……跑步……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020070","name":"樹里","text":"────あれ、凛世……","trans":"────咦，凛世……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020080","name":"凛世","text":"いっ・て・らっ・しゃ・い・ま・せ……！","trans":"您·请·慢·走……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020090","name":"樹里","text":"……あははっ\r\n見送ってくれてる","trans":"……啊哈哈\n是在送我啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020110","name":"樹里","text":"────んっ……","trans":"────嗯……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020120","name":"樹里","text":"……お\r\nおかえりー","trans":"……哦\n欢迎回来——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020130","name":"凛世","text":"はい……\r\n戻りました……","trans":"嗯……\n我回来了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020150","name":"凛世","text":"ふふっ……\r\n宿題は……捗りませんか……？","trans":"呵呵……\n作业……不太顺利吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020160","name":"樹里","text":"や、\r\nなんとなくぼんやりするっつーか","trans":"不，\n就是总觉得有点发呆，怎么说呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020170","name":"樹里","text":"ダメだダメだ！","trans":"不行不行！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020190","name":"凛世","text":"朝も……早かったのです……\r\nご無理をされませんよう……","trans":"早上也……起得很早……\n请您别太勉强自己……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020200","name":"樹里","text":"無理とかは全然！\r\nちょっと風でも入れて────","trans":"完全不勉强！\n开个窗透点风────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020210","name":"樹里","text":"あははっ\r\nいい風だ……！","trans":"啊哈哈\n好风……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020220","name":"凛世","text":"はい……\r\n心地よい風……","trans":"嗯……\n很舒服的风……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020230","name":"樹里","text":"……うしっ\r\nんじゃ、やるか！","trans":"……好\n那么，开干吧！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020240","name":"凛世","text":"はい……","trans":"好的……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020270","name":"樹里","text":"……\r\nなー","trans":"……\n我说——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020290","name":"樹里","text":"……これ、ここさ\r\n句と節ってやつ","trans":"……这个，这里\n就是所谓的短语和从句吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020310","name":"樹里","text":"この『to think so』ってとこはさ────","trans":"这个“to think so”的地方────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020330","name":"樹里","text":"じゃねーよな……！\r\n凛世、１年だった","trans":"也不是那样吧……！\n凛世，是一年级的啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020350","name":"樹里","text":"あははっ、なしなし！　わりー\r\nなんつーか、つい……","trans":"啊哈哈，不算不算！　抱歉\n怎么说呢，一不小心……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020360","name":"樹里","text":"凛世のこと、同い年みたいに思っちまうんだよなー……！","trans":"我老是把凛世当成同龄人……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020370","name":"凛世","text":"あの……それは……","trans":"那个……那是……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020380","name":"樹里","text":"だってさ、ユニットに学年はねーし","trans":"毕竟啊，组合里又没有学年之分","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020390","name":"樹里","text":"こうやって一緒に生活してたら、\r\n上とか下じゃねーし","trans":"像这样一起生活的话，\n就没有什么上下之分","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020410","name":"凛世","text":"凛世は……年少でございます……\r\n樹里先輩……","trans":"凛世……是年纪小的……\n树里前辈……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020420","name":"樹里","text":"うわっ\r\nやめてくれって！","trans":"哇\n别这样啊！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020430","name":"凛世","text":"────でも……嬉しい……","trans":"────不过……我很高兴……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020460","name":"樹里","text":"──────ん…………\r\n…………──────","trans":"──────嗯…………\n…………──────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020470","name":"凛世","text":"やっぱり……\r\nお疲れだった……","trans":"果然……\n是累了吧……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020490","name":"凛世","text":"──────シャンプー……","trans":"──────洗发水……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-190","name":"off","text":"『シャンプーの匂いがする』","trans":"“有洗发水的味道”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-191","name":"off","text":"『風が吹いて……』","trans":"“风吹过来……”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-192","name":"off","text":"『シャンプーの匂いがして』","trans":"“带着洗发水的味道”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020510","name":"凛世","text":"────まつげ……長いな……","trans":"────睫毛……好长啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020530","name":"凛世","text":"……\r\n不思議です……","trans":"……\n真是不可思议……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020540","name":"凛世","text":"まつげが……長い……","trans":"睫毛……好长……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-214","name":"off","text":"相手に特別な思いがあることを\r\n象徴的に表現する手法かと思ったの","trans":"对对方怀有特别的感情\n我想这是象征性地表达那种心情的手法","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020550","name":"凛世","text":"確かに……\r\n特別なことなのでしょう……","trans":"确实……\n是特别的事吧……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3012015020560","name":"凛世","text":"特別に……\r\nあたたかな気持ち……","trans":"格外……\n温暖的心情……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}